[00:08.00]Distant witch laughter "हीहीहीही...", owl hooting, dholak builds slowly.
[00:10.69]Whispered female vocals, each closer:
[00:13.38]पिंकी...
[00:16.08]पिंकी...
[00:18.77]पिंकी..." (right ear, suddenly loud) "हु!
[00:21.46]Dhol blast. Thunder strike. Bass drop.
[00:24.15]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
