[02:06.44]Payal rings alone again...
[02:09.13]Female laugh - but voice is not hers: "हीही...
[02:11.82]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
[02:14.51]Witch's sexy laugh: "हीहीहीही...
[02:17.20]Disco lights flicker... stop... one light remains.
[02:19.90]Footsteps dance in darkness - but stage is empty.
[02:22.59]Payal bells pan left to right.
[02:25.28]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
[02:27.97]Flowing, melodic but deeply unsettling. Romance turning cold.
[02:30.66]बालां का गजरा - उजियारा (वाह वाह!)
[02:33.36]ओली सी फिरजा - उजियारा (हाय!)
[02:36.05]बाणा तेरा प्यारा प्यारा, (सुन्दर सुन्दर!)
